    <string name="tv_text_033">Small backlight test</string>
    <string name="tv_text_034">Keep this input and picture mode unchanged. Change the native level by five points, then attempt restoration after 15 seconds. Watch the real panel and Backlight slider. If interrupted, use native TV Settings to recover.</string>
