    <string name="tv_text_036">Did the panel change and return?</string>
    <string name="tv_text_037">Confirm only if you saw the physical backlight change and the original level return, and checked current input/picture behaviour. This enables native control on the tested setup. It does not qualify fades or other source/HDR modes.</string>
